# evidence 原始日志/数据不进仓库：上传 Modal Volume yeto-evidence-archive，
# 并在该 change 的 evidence/ARCHIVE-MANIFEST.tsv 登记（见 docs/EVIDENCE_STORAGE.md）。
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.log
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.jsonl
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.parquet
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.gz
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.part
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.out
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.err
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.tar
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.zst
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.npy
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.pt
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.bin
openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.pyc
# 放行：摘要、清单、文档
!openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*summary*
!openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*manifest*
!openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/*.md
!openspec/changes/*/evidence/**/ARCHIVE-MANIFEST.tsv
# 放行：仍在仓库中的现有 evidence 文件（被测试/代码读取，或被文档引用的小文件）
